    "innovation": "This paper systematically compares simulations of the Medieval Warm Period, Little Ice Age, and 20th century using the FGOALS model, differentiating the externally-forced (coherent rainfall) and internally-driven (dipole rainfall) modes of East Asian summer monsoon variability and their response to distinct climate forcings.",
