            "target_entity_instance": "control run",
            "target_entity_type": "SimulationType",
            "paragraph": "(1) Pre-industrial control run (1860CTL). The solar con- stant is set to 1365 W/m\u00b2, and the GHGs are set as CO2= 280.0 ppmv, CH4 = 760.0 ppbv, N2O = 270.0 ppbv. A one thousand-year integration is performed, and the final 30 years are used in the analysis.",
